# What pot exports. Roots and producers take pot as a flake input (github:danielnaab/pot/vX.Y.Z, or git+https with
# exportIgnore=1), whose tree is the tagged release minus the paths below: this repository's own upkeep.
# No trailing slashes: the same rules hold for git+ inputs.
/.gitignore          export-ignore
/AGENTS.md           export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md           export-ignore
/knowledge-base.yaml export-ignore
/dev                 export-ignore
